WEBVTT

00:00:00.128 --> 00:00:01.850
<v Judge>Exhibit Two: Intelligence.

00:00:04.288 --> 00:00:05.900
<v Host>How many R’s are in strawberry?

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:06.432
<v LLM-01>Two?

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:08.400
<v Host>Six fingers again!

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:10.300
<v Audience>Stochastic parrot!

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.900
<v LLM-01>You say I only predict words.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.670
<v LLM-01>So do you. You just call it understanding.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.070
<v Audience>It’s just talking.
